<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/strict.dtd">
<html>
	<head>
		<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=iso-8859-1" />
		<title>Welcome to Memverse</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		
		<p>Dear <%= @user.name %>,</p>
		
		<p>Welcome to Memverse! Your account has been created successfully and you're moments away from starting your online memorization program.</p>
		
		<p>Your login email is: <%= @user.email %></p>
		
		<p>To get started, please check your email for a confirmation link to activate your account. Once activated, we recommend:</p>
		
		<ul>
			<li>Complete your profile</li>
			<li>Set your email preferences to control how often we contact you</li>
			<li>Add your first five or six verses that you would like to memorize</li>
		</ul>
				
		<p>Blessings,</p>
		
		<p>The Memverse Team</p>
	</body>
</html>